Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ChargesTMGAsympt", "::", "usage"}], " ", "=", " ",
   "\"\<ChargesTMGAsympt[xiU_,hdd_,mu_,{signatureg_,signepsUUU_},{index1_,\
index2_},{coordAsympt_,LimitAsympt_}, order_] compute asymptotically the \
surface charge in Topologically massive gravity\nNeed = metric and coord \
should be defined and RGtensors[...] should have been executed prior to this \
procedure\nInput = A Killing vector or asymptotic Killing vector 'xiU' \n     \
   A metric perturbation 'hdd'\n\t    The signature of the metric \
'signatureg' (1 or -1) and the convention for the epsilon tensor with upper \
indices \n               eps^{123} = 'signepsUUU' where 123 is the order of \
the coordinates 'coord'\n        mu : Gravitational Chern-Simons coupling\n   \
     A surface of codimension 2 specified by the two indices \
'{index1,index2}' in the coordinates coord that are fixed\n        The \
coordinate to expand onto 'coordAsympt', the value of the coordinate at the \
limit 'LimitAsympt' and the number of terms wished in the final expansion \
'order' \nOutput = The components {index1,index2} of the surface charge \
associated with the vector xiU under the perturbation\nExtra output : \
ChargeSuppl : supplementary term with respect to the covariant phase space \
formula.\nConvention : The Lagrangian has the form (1/(16\[Pi]) \
Sqrt[signatureg g] (R + 1/mu Topological Chern-Simons). \n             The \
equations of motion are G_{\\mu\\nu}+1/mu C_{\\mu\\nu} = 0\nOrigin : The \
formulae are taken from 0808.1911. The charges -('Charges' - 'ChargeSuppl') \
are equal to the charges defined in 0706.0263.\n\>\""}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.449078349953125*^9, 3.44907845025*^9}, {
   3.449078599375*^9, 3.449078648984375*^9}, {3.449078723953125*^9,
